WEBVTT

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:00.499
HI: So it's always a balance

00:18:00.523 --> 00:18:04.036
of what stays permanent,
what's continuous,

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:06.096
what's core to who you are

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:10.676
and then what is it that you're going
to grow, learn and discover.

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:13.456
We come to inflection points in our lives

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:15.322
in which we say, "Hey, wait a minute.

00:18:15.346 --> 00:18:18.348
I'm so much more than this,

00:18:18.372 --> 00:18:21.416
and I want to give
some attention to that."

00:18:21.440 --> 00:18:22.635
AG: Yet for some people,

00:18:22.659 --> 00:18:25.315
the effort to develop and express
their authentic selves

00:18:25.339 --> 00:18:26.726
has extra landmines.

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:28.250
More on that after the break.

00:18:28.274 --> 00:18:30.857
(WorkLife theme music)